{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0214","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:0000010a:text","row":29895,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"水曜日。","en":"Wednesday.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800713","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00001","en":"Wednesday.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:0000012a:text","row":29896,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"ニュートンも失笑、惰性の法則に従って学校に行く。","en":"Even Newton would laugh: I coast to school under the law of sheer inertia.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800714","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00002","en":"Even Newton would end up laughing at how I am going to school in obedience to the Law of Inertia.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000172:text","row":29897,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"坂を歩く。","en":"I walk up the hill.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800715","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00003","en":"I walk the hills.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000194:text","row":29898,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"いつもながら勾配がきつい。","en":"As always, the grade is brutal.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800716","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00004","en":"The inclines are severe, as always.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000001c6:text","row":29899,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"歩みは遅くなる。","en":"My pace slows.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800717","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00005","en":"Pace grows slower.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000001ee:text","row":29900,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ようやっと平らな場所に出る。","en":"At last, I reach level ground.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800718","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00006","en":"At last I come out into a flat place.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000440:text","row":29901,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800719","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00007","en":"Taichi: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000462:text","row":29902,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"予感に焙(あぶ)られて、意識が加熱した。","en":"A premonition roasts me; my mind flares hot.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800720","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00008","en":"Broiled by a premonition, awareness heats up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000004a0:text","row":29903,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"理性よりはやく体は動く。","en":"My body moves before reason can.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800721","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00009","en":"The body moves faster than rationality.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000004d0:text","row":29904,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"振り返った！","en":"I whirl around!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800722","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00010","en":"I turned around!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000004fc:text","row":29905,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………いないか」","en":"“…………No one's there.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800723","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00011","en":"Taichi: \"......not there?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000528:text","row":29906,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"人の気配を感じたのに。","en":"Even though I felt someone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800724","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00012","en":"But I felt the presence of a person.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000556:text","row":29907,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"そう……七香のだ。","en":"Yes... Nanaka's.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800725","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00013","en":"Yes... Nanaka's.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000580:text","row":29908,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"祠に行ってから、一度も姿を見せていない。","en":"She hasn't shown herself once since I went to the shrine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800726","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00014","en":"Since I went to the hokora she has not shown herself, not once.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000005c0:text","row":29909,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女はこの世界に起こっていることを知っている。","en":"She knows what's happening to this world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800727","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00015","en":"That girl knows what has happened in this world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000606:text","row":29910,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"ではなぜ俺は、七香を捜さないのか。","en":"Then why am I not looking for her?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800728","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00016","en":"Then why am I not going searching for Nanaka?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000640:text","row":29911,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"おそらく……見つからないから。","en":"Probably... because I won't find her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800729","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00017","en":"I would say... because I would not find her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:00000676:text","row":29912,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"七香は見つからない。決して。","en":"Nanaka can't be found. Ever.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800730","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00018","en":"I won't find Nanaka. Never.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0214:000006aa:text","row":29913,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"そんな気がした。","en":"That's the feeling I get.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800731","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036a:00019","en":"That was the feeling I had.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
